{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023858_f4727992","chunk_index":21,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0685b59028fb9fc4"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023858_f4727992","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"避孕的规定与方法","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）中生殖毒性与避孕相关资料","申办者针对本项目的避孕方法、避孕持续时间与妊娠监测决策文件","妊娠检查与妊娠事件报告流程的项目文件","既往同类口服系统治疗药物的生殖安全性与避孕要求资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认研究事实明确妊娠或哺乳期受试者被排除于研究人群，并给出筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周、安全性随访期4周以及第20周安全性随访访视的时间框架；但未提供可接受与不可接受的避孕方法、避孕持续时间、妊娠检查频率及妊娠事件报告要求。上述实施规则需由医学作者依据研究者手册中的生殖毒性资料和申办者针对本项目的避孕与妊娠监测决策核对确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（避孕的规定与方法），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_821ddd4ec4423824","section_number":"14.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d49938f648888995549cada","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023858_f4727992","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究量表和评价工具","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节正文直接采用已确认研究事实：PASI、sPGA与DLQI为评价工具；主要终点为第16周PASI 75应答（较基线改善≥75%），关键次要终点为第16周sPGA达0或1且较基线改善≥2级及第16周PASI 90应答，其他次要终点为第16周PASI与DLQI评分较基线的变化；PASI和sPGA评价时点为基线及第4、8、12、16周。医学作者需核对量表中文版本、使用授权与评分培训要求，并确认DLQI基线及各访视的具体评价安排。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_47144bb8ad86d32f","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d49938f648888995549cada","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846:e7a96b3314e879"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922023858_f4727992","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"实验室检查项目","missing_source_classes":["中心实验室手册（实验室检查项目、样本采集与处理要求）","研究者手册（IB）中临床前与临床安全性资料","申办者关于实验室异常值判定与重复检测的规则文件","既往同类药物临床研究的实验室监测方案"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认研究事实将实验室检查列为安全性评价内容之一，并给出第2、4、8、12、16周治疗期访视与第20周安全性随访安排；但未提供实验室检查项目清单、样本采集与处理要求、检测单位信息以及异常结果判定与重复检测规则。医学作者需依据中心实验室手册与研究者手册核对后补齐本章节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1ce08f07f41bcedd","section_number":"14.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:6d49938f648888995549cada","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:semantic_window:6520ebbe09a51d:c0f9d8189ccfc6:85ee0ac32bdcdc:ed8c7e23cb9a85:f4b0433bf35190:c9b1b1d4f3b846","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:se